Accordingly, it is directed that applicant Vikas Kushwah shall be released on bail in relation to Crime No.401 of 2023 registered at Police Station Kailaras, District Morena (M.P.), for offence punishable under Sections 363, 366, 376 of IPC and Section 5/6 of POCSO Act, upon furnishing a personal bond in the sum of Rs.50,000/- (Rs. Fifty Thousand Only) with one solvent surety of the same amount to the satisfaction of the Trial Court, for compliance with the following conditions, :
(For the sake of convenience of understanding by accused and surety, the conditions of bail are also reproduced in Hindi as under):-
